            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.32

- Sign in again works when an account's slot holds a stray copy of another account's login.
- A notification names the account to sign in again when its login was replaced.
- Live limits are no longer credited to the wrong account after a move.

Thanks to brandeddaniel for the fixes.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
